      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DYNAMITE ERIC (2) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a strong early sectional and went on to clock 27.49 in a 3 length win at this track over 485m. Comes through a solid form race last start. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. DEEP THINKER (3) ran below best last time finishing fourth (30.76) over 525m at The Meadows from Box 5. Great chance to atone. MISTER MANFREDI (4) finds it hard to win. Finished second (30.32) at Sandown latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Must be included in calculations. CACO MAGIC (6) was in the money last time at Sandown (34.83) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4 length second. Has four wins already from this draw.",
